---
# Why RIPS? (CR-04, the owner's request of 18 October 2026 for a "Why RIPS?" tab, in the same design
# language as Home under CR-03). Facilities are as seen in the RIPS campus tour video; claims taken from
# that video's own description (hospital training, scholarships, internships, faculty, affiliation) are
# drafts until the Principal confirms them (data-draft).
layout: base.njk
permalink: /why-rips/
title: Why RIPS?
description: "Why study at Radiant Institute of Professional Studies (RIPS), Sheikhupura: its programs, labs, library, computer lab, student lounge and Admission Office."
bodyClass: why cine-page
reasons:
  - title: Programs for real careers
    id: programs
    img: anatomy-lab
    alt: Students gathered around a skeleton model in a RIPS lab, with anatomy models on the shelves behind them.
    text: "BS and intermediate programs in health sciences, computing, management and the humanities."
    link: { label: See all programs, url: /programs/ }
  - title: Labs for hands-on learning
    id: labs
    img: science-lab
    alt: Two students at work at a lab bench beside a glassware cabinet in a RIPS lab.
    text: "An anatomy lab with skeletons and models, and science labs with benches, microscopes and equipment, so practical classes happen on campus."
    draft_text: "Students of health-science programs also train in real hospital settings."
    draft: OD-07
  - title: A computer lab for every student
    id: computer-lab
    img: computer-lab
    alt: Students working at rows of desktop computers in the RIPS computer lab.
    text: "Rows of desktop computers for hands-on computing classes, assignments and research."
  - title: A library for quiet study
    id: library
    img: library
    alt: A student reading at a table in front of the library shelves at RIPS.
    text: "Shelves of books and long reading tables where students can read and work between classes."
  - title: Classrooms built for discussion
    id: classrooms
    img: classroom
    alt: A class of students at their desks while a teacher speaks at the whiteboard.
    text: "Classrooms with whiteboards for lectures, presentations and discussion."
    draft_text: "Classes are taught by qualified, experienced faculty."
    draft: OD-07
  - title: Room to relax
    id: lounge
    img: student-lounge
    alt: Students sitting and talking at a long table in the RIPS student lounge.
    text: "A student lounge to meet friends and talk between classes."
  - title: Help with your application
    id: admissions
    img: admission-office
    alt: The white RIPS Admission Office building with its glass front and name above the door.
    text: "A separate Admission Office building on campus, where the admissions team helps you choose a program and apply."
    link: { label: How to apply, url: /admissions/ }
---
{%- set programs = collections.programs | activePrograms -%}
{%- set fields = programs | groupby("data.field") %}

<section class="page-hero" aria-labelledby="why-title">
  <picture class="page-hero-media">
    <img src="/assets/img/campus/entrance-640.webp" srcset="/assets/img/campus/entrance-400.webp 400w, /assets/img/campus/entrance-640.webp 640w" sizes="100vw" width="640" height="360" alt="" fetchpriority="high">
  </picture>
  <div class="page-hero-body on-dark">
    <div class="wrap">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <ol>
          <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
          <li><span aria-current="page">Why RIPS?</span></li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
      <h1 id="why-title">Why RIPS?</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">{{ settings.tagline }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" aria-label="At a glance">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="why-intro">{{ settings.name }} is a private educational institute in {{ settings.place }}, with {{ programs.length }} BS and intermediate programs in {{ fields | length }} fields, its own labs, library and computer lab, and an Admission Office on campus to help you apply.</p>
    <ul class="why-facts">
      <li><strong>{{ programs.length }}</strong><span>programs</span></li>
      <li><strong>{{ fields | length }}</strong><span>fields of study</span></li>
      <li><strong>BS</strong><span>and intermediate</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band-soft" aria-labelledby="reasons-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Life at RIPS</p>
      <h2 id="reasons-title">Seven reasons to choose RIPS</h2>
    </header>
    <ol class="reason-list">
      {%- for r in reasons %}
      <li class="reason" id="{{ r.id }}">
        <img src="/assets/img/campus/{{ r.img }}-640.webp" srcset="/assets/img/campus/{{ r.img }}-400.webp 400w, /assets/img/campus/{{ r.img }}-640.webp 640w" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 34rem, 92vw" width="640" height="360" alt="{{ r.alt }}" loading="lazy">
        <div class="reason-body">
          <p class="reason-num" aria-hidden="true">{{ "0" if loop.index < 10 }}{{ loop.index }}</p>
          <h3>{{ r.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ r.text }}{% if r.draft_text %} <span data-draft="{{ r.draft }}">{{ r.draft_text }}</span>{% endif %}</p>
          {%- if r.link %}
          <p><a class="see-all" href="{{ r.link.url }}">{{ r.link.label }} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
          {%- endif %}
        </div>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ol>
    <p class="photo-note">Photos are stills from the RIPS campus tour video.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" aria-labelledby="support-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Beyond the classroom</p>
      <h2 id="support-title">Support for your future</h2>
    </header>
    <ul class="feature-grid">
      <li data-draft="OD-07"><h3>Scholarships</h3><p>Merit-based scholarships for students with strong results. Ask the Admission Office what you may qualify for.</p></li>
      <li data-draft="OD-07"><h3>Internships</h3><p>Paid internships in the final year, so you leave with real work experience.</p></li>
      <li data-draft="OD-08"><h3>Recognised degrees</h3><p>BS programs are affiliated with GC University Faisalabad. <a href="/about/affiliation/">See affiliation and approvals</a>.</p></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band on-dark" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="cta-title">Come and see the campus</h2>
    <p>Talk to the admissions team, or visit the Admission Office, open {{ settings.office_hours }}.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/enquire/">Enquire</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="https://wa.me/{{ settings.whatsapp_link }}?text={{ settings.whatsapp_message | urlencode }}" rel="noopener">WhatsApp <span class="small">(opens WhatsApp)</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn-link" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ccsk4uAyFLM" rel="noopener">Watch the campus tour <span class="small">(opens YouTube)</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
